  {
   "id": "b02-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 764,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: another primary next hop that avoids the failed link",
   "originalText": "The rule: another primary next hop that avoids the failed link",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b02-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "D is ECMP-protected against the failure of primary link S→E when S has another primary next hop N (on a\nshortest path to D) whose own path to D avoids S→E (B1, with X = N, Y = D):",
   "originalText": "D is ECMP-protected against the failure of primary link S→E when S has another primary next hop N (on a\nshortest path to D) whose own path to D avoids S→E (B1, with X = N, Y = D):",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b02-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 768,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "N ≠ the failed link’s next hop, and   dist(N,D) < dist(N,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,D)",
   "originalText": "N ≠ the failed link’s next hop, and   dist(N,D) < dist(N,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,D)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b02-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 249,
   "width": 723,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "L1 → L2, fail L1–SP1:  other next hop SP2\n   dist(SP2,L2) = 10 < dist(SP2,L1) + c(L1,SP1) + dist(SP1,L2) = 10 + 10 + 10 = 30   ✓\nL1 → L2, fail L1–SP2:  other next hop SP1\n   dist(SP1,L2) = 10 < dist(SP1,L1) + c(L1,SP2) + dist(SP2,L2) = 10 + 10 + 10 = 30   ✓\nL1 → SP1, fail L1–SP1: only one next hop (dist(L1,SP1) = 10, via SP2 it is 30)   ✗",
   "originalText": "L1 → L2, fail L1–SP1:  other next hop SP2\n   dist(SP2,L2) = 10 < dist(SP2,L1) + c(L1,SP1) + dist(SP1,L2) = 10 + 10 + 10 = 30   ✓\nL1 → L2, fail L1–SP2:  other next hop SP1\n   dist(SP1,L2) = 10 < dist(SP1,L1) + c(L1,SP2) + dist(SP2,L2) = 10 + 10 + 10 = 30   ✓\nL1 → SP1, fail L1–SP1: only one next hop (dist(L1,SP1) = 10, via SP2 it is 30)   ✗",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b02-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 347,
   "width": 192,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why it comes first",
   "originalText": "Why it comes first",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b02-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 381,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S already forwards over N. When S→E fails, S just stops using it: no tunnel, no labels, no switch to a\npre-computed backup. So the results table credits a pair to ECMP before LFA, Remote LFA and TI-LFA\n(B20). In coverage it counts as LFA too.",
   "originalText": "S already forwards over N. When S→E fails, S just stops using it: no tunnel, no labels, no switch to a\npre-computed backup. So the results table credits a pair to ECMP before LFA, Remote LFA and TI-LFA\n(B20). In coverage it counts as LFA too.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b02-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 455,
   "width": 594,
   "height": 57,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "L1 as the source:   8 pairs, ECMP 6 (L2, L3, L4 × 2 links),\n                    the 2 spines need Remote LFA (PQ L2) or TI-LFA\nEvery router:      48 pairs, ECMP 32",
   "originalText": "L1 as the source:   8 pairs, ECMP 6 (L2, L3, L4 × 2 links),\n                    the 2 spines need Remote LFA (PQ L2) or TI-LFA\nEvery router:      48 pairs, ECMP 32",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
