   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Parallel links (A10): another equal-cost link to\n   E itself counts.\n•  An excluded neighbor (A16) still counts: ECMP is\n   normal forwarding, not an alternate.\n•  Overload bit (A17): no change; an overloaded\n   router is a next hop only for its own address.",
   "originalText": "•  Parallel links (A10): another equal-cost link to\n   E itself counts.\n•  An excluded neighbor (A16) still counts: ECMP is\n   normal forwarding, not an alternate.\n•  Overload bit (A17): no change; an overloaded\n   router is a next hop only for its own address.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
